name: sim.setGraphStreamValue
description: Sets the next value to be recorded for a graph stream
luaSynopsis: sim.setGraphStreamValue(int graphHandle, int streamId, float value)
pythonSynopsis: sim.setGraphStreamValue(int graphHandle, int streamId, float value)
inputs:
1. graphHandle: handle of the graph object
2. streamId: id of the stream
3. value: value to set. Omitting to set a value for a corresponding sim.handleGraph call, then the data point will be missing.
outputs:
